WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.502
01  /  PRACTICE     A short session. A little more fluent.

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:07.853
Choose English practice. Set the length to fit your day.

00:00:07.853 --> 00:00:13.197
Read the prompt, then write your answer.

00:00:13.197 --> 00:00:17.001
Submit your answer and get immediate feedback.

00:00:17.001 --> 00:00:20.720
Your session is saved on this device. Keep your progress.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.889
02  /  STUDY     Pick a topic. Focus on one sentence.

00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:29.953
Try the rewrite yourself before revealing the answer.

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:34.503
Active to passive: the proposal becomes the subject.

00:00:34.503 --> 00:00:36.492
03  /  UNDERSTAND     Ask why this rewrite works.

00:00:36.492 --> 00:00:45.496
Read the explanation and see the teaching reference behind it.

00:00:45.496 --> 00:00:49.288
Practice. Review. Understand.   /   LinguaFlow
